SOAPBOX: My most modest antenna since childhood: An Alpha Delta 5 band dipole with center at 14'
SOAPBOX: Works as you'd bet a dipole would except on 80 where it is more like a narrow band dummy load.
SOAPBOX: When I went from sacked monobanders in the country to a tribander at 40' in the suburbs
SOAPBOX: I found the secret to happiness was to run a KW and imagine I'm Low Power.
SOAPBOX: Now I run 100 watts and pretend I'm QRP.
